    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 as a starter or 2 as a main and takes about 50 minutes. The critical thing to watch when emulsifying is to add the warm oil slowly while beating constantly, just like making mayonnaise. Too fast and it will not come together."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If using salted dried cod, soak it in cold water for at least 24 hours before starting, changing the water 2-3 times. Fresh unsalted cod fillet makes a lighter, faster version that still works beautifully."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
